      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "A request can wait for retrieval before the synthesis model allocates its history. Final checking can continue after that history is released. Apply arrival rate times mean residence time to the chosen boundary. Under these supplied steady-state assumptions, total search requests in flight exceed requests with synthesis key-value state resident.",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 21.855999999999998,
          "duration": 21.456,
          "until": 22.505999999999997
        },
        {
          "say": "Now size that resident state from layers, stored heads, head width, precision, and time-weighted cached positions. Compare the memory lower bound with a separate output-throughput lower bound. The same worker fleet may need to satisfy both. Their maximum still omits prefill, batching, bursts, failures, and headroom, so benchmark the joint workload before choosing capacity.",
          "start": 22.505999999999997,
          "end": 46.434,
          "duration": 23.928,
          "until": 47.083999999999996
        }
      ],
